# =============================================================================
# COOKING SHIT WITH NEIL MCMANISTAN — the sequel show, and a demotion.
#
# What happened in between, and every beat of this one leans on it: the root was
# a front, Nguyen got deported, the network dropped them over "the unregulated
# drugs and the anti semitism allegations", and the whole operation is now a
# phone on a tripod in a church basement running on a priest's WiFi.
#
# THE PRODUCER IS BILLED, NOT NAMED. `@billing` is what puts PRODUCER on screen
# while the NPC stays Phil McCracken everywhere else in the world — which is the
# entire load-bearing joke of the back half, when Neil uses his actual name on
# air and he asks him not to. Do not "fix" that to @alias.
#
# The set is not a set this time. Last show's basement was a replica of somebody
# else's basement; this is a real kitchen belonging to real women who left real
# notes on the cupboards, and Neil is stealing from the food bank in it.
# =============================================================================

